  "bodyHash": "5d877bb81b7e68ac",
  "content": "\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"GitHub\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n這個模組新增了一堆復古飛機，讓你旅行、運輸與探索！\n這些飛機非常注重還原原版風格，擁有許多細節與功能，但絕不過於複雜。\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:aircraft&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"></p>\n<p>對了，還支援多人遊戲！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>雙翼機</h1>\n<p>我們從經典的雙翼機開始。速度快，單座，難度中等。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/biplane.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>飛艇</h1>\n<p>速度較慢，但可容納兩名乘客。非常易於操控，加上後置引擎提供可接受的飛行速度。還有\n體積更大的貨運版本！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/airship.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>旋翼機</h1>\n<p>人力驅動的原生雙座機。可靠耐用，但既不是最快的也不是最容易駕駛的。需要用力助推\n才能讓旋翼轉起來。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/gyrodyne.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>四軸飛行器</h1>\n<p>工程學的傑作！四個螺旋槳綁在一堆竹子上。在建築時相當好用。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/quadrocopter.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>戰艦</h1>\n<p>\n銅鐵鑄成的空中猛獸，為了征服天空而生！\n四個座位、可轉動砲塔、六個武器掛載點，體型比 Minecraft 的物理引擎預期的還要大。\n</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/warship.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>一些可組裝的物品</h1>\n<p>由於飛機通常比船隻等交通工具更複雜，因此新增了一些物品，讓製作\n飛機的過程更有實際組裝的感覺。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_aircraft:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成表圖片\"></p>\n<h1>物品欄</h1>\n<p>升級槽位、燃料、旗幟、染料、火箭推進器與儲物空間。為你的飛機打造專屬外觀！</p>\n<p><img width=\"550\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=550,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/inventory.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p>\n<h1>多種升級</h1>\n<p>根據你的喜好升級並調校你的飛機！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:upgrades&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"></p>\n<p>為你的飛機安裝各種武器與實用配件！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_aircraft:weapons&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&c=1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"></p>\n<h1>影片</h1>\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-XOlaZHOu4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n<h1>擴充模組</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=多機擴充&description=專為《Immersive Aircraft》設計的額外飛機擴充模組，並考慮了與 Create 的整合。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"多機擴充\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式機械&description=一堆復古機械，用於運輸、採礦與自動化。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aviator-dreams\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=飛行員之夢&description=從小型到大型，還原現實生活中的飛機。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1100/961/64/64/638648594348458560.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"飛行員之夢\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ia-remaining-airborne\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=殘存戰機&description=一系列經典戰鬥機。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1168/829/64/64/638739800864929977.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"殘存戰機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warfare-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=戰爭之翼&description=新增多款二戰戰鬥機，並附有不同塗裝設計。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1225/83/64/64/638802892619093611.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"戰爭之翼\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fia_engines\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=更優引擎&description=新增大量升級項目，主要為引擎，但也包含渦輪增壓器與機械增壓器。&icon_url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/legoaggelos/ia_engines/refs/heads/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/more_engines/textures/item/supercharger.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"更優引擎\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/civilian-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=民用航空&description=收錄各個時代風格化的現實飛機與直升機！&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1808/958/256/256/639144393942056440.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"民用航空\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>資源包</h1>\n<p>\n不喜歡我的風格，或希望更好地整合 Create？來看看這裡的精彩資源包吧！</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=更多沉浸式飛機&description=適合原版風格，為《Immersive Aircraft》提供更寫實的貼圖。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1180/610/64/64/638753853503436917.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"更多沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create 沉浸式飛機&description=採用 Create 風格的《Immersive Aircraft》資源包與資料包。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/849/496/64/64/638250478085753003.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-modded-compats\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create 風格相容包&description=採用 Create 風格的物品貼圖。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/485/413/64/64/637785634308178232.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 風格相容包\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=忠實還原 - 沉浸式飛機&description=專為《Immersive Aircraft》打造的 FAITHFUL 32x 資源包。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/431/64/64/638160303843226902.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"忠實還原 - 沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create IA：戰艦&description=為戰艦打造的 Create 風格貼圖。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1004/277/64/64/638525212330806757.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create IA：戰艦\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create 花崗閃長石箱子&description=為所有飛機打造的 Create 風格花崗閃長石箱子。&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1010/406/64/64/638534030337746940.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create 花崗閃長石箱子\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/danceboys-biplane-to-xwing\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Danceboys X翼戰機&description=將雙翼機替換為 X 翼戰機！&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1327/379/64/64/638862867702387346.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Danceboys X翼戰機\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>沉浸式系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式護甲&description=大量獨特且符合原版風格的護甲套裝。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式護甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式飛機&description=一堆復古飛機，讓你旅行、運輸與探索！&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飛機\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式旋律&description=用各種樂器演奏自訂旋律，煩擾你的朋友吧！&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式畫作&description=拖曳放置、像素化並掛上美麗的藝術作品。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式畫作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式最佳化&description=輕量化的實體刻排程器，讓你的 TPS 翻倍。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式最佳化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=在無關時機隱藏難看的方塊選取框線。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式傢俱&description=在遊戲內創建客製化且精美的傢俱，或從龐大的線上庫中選擇。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式傢俱\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式傳送門&description=散落在主世界的神祕遺忘傳送門。&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式傳送門\">\n</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=172ed73c9c7b23b143085297e790a860\" alt=\"便於頁面部署的頁面雜湊值。\"></p>",
